This directory exists so `public/` is present in a fresh checkout.

Next serves anything here at the site root. It is deliberately almost empty: the favicon, the Apple
touch icon, the web manifest and the default social card are all produced by the FILE CONVENTIONS in
`app/` (icon.svg, apple-icon.tsx, manifest.ts, opengraph-image.tsx), which keeps them in step with the
institution's configured name instead of going stale as committed binaries.

⚠ Do not delete the directory. `Dockerfile` copies it into the runtime image, and a `COPY` of a path
that does not exist fails the build with "not found" — which is how this file came to be written.
